const files = {
  "AGENTS.md": `# Brokerage Control API Federation\n\nThis package root is the sovereign federation enterprise for a scalable market in paid brokerage-control APIs. It is not an Esther-specific trading bot and has no universal capital ceiling. Customer mandates parameterize capital, loss, concentration, liquidity, execution, instruments, compute budget, venue, and revocation. Esther Davis's approximately USD 100 account is the first sponsored instance only.\n\nCustomer-controlled payment wallets may fund metered compute; venue-issued funding wallets may fund brokerage accounts; provider payout wallets receive service consideration. These are distinct roles joined only by explicit contracts. No private key, seed, OAuth token, API secret, brokerage asset, or ambient signing authority crosses a settlement membrane.\n\nThe federation owns composition and portfolio books, not provider work, customer assets, marketplace settlement, or verification. Each descendant package is sovereign, separately hireable, and may refuse. Aggressive alpha permits full concentration or accepted total loss when the customer's mandate allows it, while still requiring evidence, falsifiers, liquidity and execution premises, explicit scenario losses, and an independently replayable policy digest.\n`,
